<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>출결 현황 확인</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-[#f5f5f5] min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center font-sans antialiased py-10">

    <div class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl shadow-[0_4px_12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] max-w-md w-full mx-4 border border-gray-100">
        
        <div class="text-center mb-6">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-800 tracking-tight">당일 출결 확인</h2>
            <p id="current-date-banner" class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-medium mt-1 tracking-wider">0000-00-00 (오늘)</p>
            <div class="w-full h-[1px] bg-gray-100 mt-4"></div>
        </div>

        <div id="attendance-success-box" class="space-y-4">
            <div class="bg-blue-50/50 border border-blue-100 rounded-lg p-4 text-center mb-5">
                <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-blue-600">✓ 정상적으로 출결 확인되었습니다.</span>
            </div>

            <div class="border border-gray-100 rounded-lg divide-y divide-gray-100 overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center p-4 bg-gray-50/50">
                    <span class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-500">지역</span>
                    <span id="user-name" class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800">어느지역</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center p-4 bg-gray-50/50">
                    <span class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-500">팀/구역</span>
                    <span id="user-name" class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800">어느팀/구역</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center p-4 bg-gray-50/50">
                    <span class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-500">직책</span>
                    <span id="user-name" class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800">어느직책</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center p-4 bg-gray-50/50">
                    <span class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-500">성명</span>
                    <span id="user-name" class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800">홍길동</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center p-4">
                    <span class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-500">날짜</span>
                    <span id="attendance-date" class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">2026-05-28</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center p-4 bg-gray-50/50">
                    <span class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-500">교육 과정</span>
                    <span id="course-name" class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800 tracking-tight">푸른 어선들의 밤</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center p-4">
                    <span class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-500">체크 시간</span>
                    <span id="check-time" class="text-sm font-bold text-blue-600">09:15:24</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <p class="text-[11px] text-center text-gray-400 mt-2">* 출결 확인은 당일에만 조회 가능합니다.</p>
        </div>


        <div id="attendance-empty-box" class="hidden py-8 text-center flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-orange-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-3 border border-orange-100">
                <span class="text-xl text-orange-500 font-bold">!</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-1">출결체크된 것이 없다</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 max-w-[240px] leading-relaxed">금일 해당 교육의 출석 기록이 발견되지 않았습니다. QR 코드를 다시 스캔해 주세요.</p>
        </div>


        <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-gray-100">
            <button class="w-full py-3 px-4 bg-[#1976d2] hover:bg-[#1565c0] text-white font-semibold text-sm rounded-md shadow-[0_1px_3px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)] hover:shadow-[0_4px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)] transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out uppercase tracking-wider focus:outline-none flex items-center justify-center gap-2" onclick="moveToScanPage()">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4v1m6 11h2m-6 0h-2v4m0-11v3m0 0h.01M12 12h4.01M16 20h4M4 12h4m12 0h.01M5 8h2a1 1 0 001-1V5a1 1 0 00-1-1H5a1 1 0 00-1 1v2a1 1 0 001 1zm12 0h2a1 1 0 001-1V5a1 1 0 00-1-1h-2a1 1 0 00-1 1v2a1 1 0 001 1zM5 20h2a1 1 0 001-1v-2a1 1 0 00-1-1H5a1 1 0 00-1 1v2a1 1 0 001 1z"></path>
                </svg>
                QR 스캔 화면으로 이동
            </button>
        </div>

    </div>

    <script>
        // 무결성 검증을 위한 당일 날짜 초기화 (Client-side 표시용)
        document.getElementById('current-date-banner').innerText = new Date().toISOString().split('T')[0] + " (오늘)";

        // 화면 이동 훅 (실제 라우터 주소나 파일명으로 대체하세요)
        function moveToScanPage() {
            window.location.href = "/qr_scan"; 
        }

        /* [백엔드 제어 가이드]
          서버사이드(Node.js 등)에서 결과를 렌더링할 때 데이터 유무에 따라 클래스를 조작하세요.
          
          예시 (출결 데이터가 없을 경우 제어 로직 예시):
          document.getElementById('attendance-success-box').classList.add('hidden');
          document.getElementById('attendance-empty-box').classList.remove('hidden');
        */
    </script>
</body>
</html>